# Dockhand environment files can contain credentials.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Runtime state must never be committed.
**/data/
**/cache/
**/logs/
**/storage/
**/upload/
**/library/
**/postgres/
**/pgadmin-data/
**/acme.json

# Keep explicit placeholders when a runtime directory is documented.
!**/.gitkeep
